                    },
                    "message": "The previous check was intentionally the opposite of this.  We don't expect most payloads to be base64 encoded, so we should attempt that first.  IN theory we could have a payload (like all zeros) that's valid CPER, but base64 encodes correctly.\n\nI suspect we just need to add is_single_section in the header_is_valid check"
